lingmo-compositor (5.0.6+lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * dock: fix separator line position during magnification animation.
    The divider was positioned using only the animated section position
    without accounting for the lateral shift that magnification applies
    to icons. Now the separator follows the shift of the last pinned icon
    that precedes it, so it tracks with the icons during hover zoom.
    The trailing divider likewise follows the last application icon.

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Thu, 05 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0800

